{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:004c9273dbaf0a1a","name":"Riot Shield","source":{"id":"source:reference-004c9273dbaf0a1a","title":"Riot Shield","revision":26770,"timestamp":"2025-07-21T18:52:46Z","sha256":"e57d94a744de787ef8c01c36813b3cf1acd38f54250f2806f6cfea2ecd779d69","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26770","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Riot%20Shield&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-004c9273dbaf0a1a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Riot Shields are common gear for law enforcement and planetary defense forces. Measuring about 1 meter long and half as wide, a Riot Shield is made of a metal frame that generates an energy shield that bends light so that its outer surface is opaque, while its inner side is transparent; allowing you unobstructed vision, but not extending the same benefit to your opponents.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Riot Shield has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," score of 5, 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Break DC"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Break_DC"}," of 25. When held, a Riot Shield grants you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," (+5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},") against all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b"}," on any turn during which you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fight Defensively"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fight_Defensively","referenceId":"reference:ce11520546392760"},". You can also wield a Riot Shield as a melee weapon. When used in this way, it has the same statistics as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Baton"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Baton","referenceId":"reference:895573ffa7826a58"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:cd7a4aafaae07eb3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 1d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES (2d6)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 6 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Bludgeoning or Energy (",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"},")\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
